From 93acb52146de9986d061bc231f0513a7a13fc197 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tatsuki Tanaka <tatsuki@tanakatatsuki.dev>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 18:40:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 22/46] media: qcom: iris: add SM8450/SM8475 VPU2 encoder and
 decoder support

Add platform data and HFI Gen2 protocol support for Qualcomm VPU2
(SM8450/SM8475) video accelerators, including hardware-accelerated H.264
and HEVC decode/encode and secure ARP memory allocation.

Signed-off-by: Tatsuki Tanaka <tatsuki@tanakatatsuki.dev>
(cherry picked from commit af1b85e54f57e74b3c5f93bb5b4ba57a7857bc48)

Conflict resolution for Linux 7.3: 7.3 added the Milos firmware data next to this commit's VPU2 data; both are kept (additive).
